{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41985","headline":"新喻县酬王仲华少府见贻 · 李中","name":"新喻县酬王仲华少府见贻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"事简开樽有逸情，共忻官舍月华清。\n每慙花欠河阳景，长愧琴无单父声。\n未泰黎元惭旷职，纵行谦直是虚名。\n与君尽力行公道，敢向昌朝俟陟明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}